    {
      "id": "231:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你想要进屋去关上门，但是你晚了一步。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:54046:54066"
    },
    {
      "id": "231:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "男人撞在门上，冲击力直接把你掀翻在地。你撞在地上，天旋地转。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:54066:54098"
    },
    {
      "id": "231:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "记录你当前所在的条目，你可能需要回到当前条目。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:54098:54123"
    },
    {
      "id": "231:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "受到 1 点伤害，进行一次幸运检定。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:54123:54143"
    },
    {
      "id": "231:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定成功，转到 326。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:54143:54159"
    },
    {
      "id": "231:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，转到 232。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:54159:54175"
    }
  ]
